       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SAMMENLIGNNAVNE.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 IX               PIC 99.
       01 MATCH-COUNT      PIC 99.
       01 NAVN-LENGTH      PIC 99  VALUE 20.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 KUNDE-NAVN       PIC X(20).
       01 SANKTION-NAVN    PIC X(20).
       01 MATCH-PROCENT    PIC 999.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING KUNDE-NAVN SANKTION-NAVN MATCH-PROCENT.
       MOVE 0 TO MATCH-COUNT
       PERFORM VARYING IX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL IX > LENGTH OF KUNDE-NAVN
       IF KUNDE-NAVN(IX:1) = SANKTION-NAVN(IX:1)
           ADD 1 TO MATCH-COUNT
       END-IF
       END-PERFORM

       CALL 'OMREGNTILPROCENT' USING 
           CONTENT MATCH-COUNT NAVN-LENGTH
           REFERENCE MATCH-PROCENT

       EXIT PROGRAM.
